 Garantia 90 dias', 154.9, 154.9, NULL, 'Mom & Baby > Toys > Dolls & Stuffed Toys', 'https://cf.shopee.com.br/file/br-11134275-81z1k-mh9jzdxwv5z818', 'https://shope.ee/an_redir?origin_link=https%3A%2F%2Fshopee.com.br%2Fproduct%2F1163157664%2F48551762590', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-28T02:11:31.708458+00:00');
