on-line mas as relações são humanas, pode contar com nosso time de colaboradores!', 249.99, 199.9, NULL, 'Men Clothes > Hoodies & Sweatshirts > Hoodies', 'https://cf.shopee.com.br/file/sg-11134201-8261n-mky1lj3na4g4ce', 'https://shope.ee/an_redir?origin_link=https%3A%2F%2Fshopee.com.br%2Fproduct%2F817652731%2F58255517766', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-28T02:11:31.708458+00:00');
