,05 Litros Conteúdo da Embalagem 01 Alto Falante ETM 12 Polegadas 4 Ohms', 228.9, 228.9, NULL, 'Spare Parts and Accessories for Vehicles > Internal Accessories for Automobiles > Car Audio System', 'https://cf.shopee.com.br/file/sg-11134201-7rfg1-m3qmib3e8lif7f', 'https://shope.ee/an_redir?origin_link=https%3A%2F%2Fshopee.com.br%2Fproduct%2F379659661%2F18498023758', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-28T02:11:31.708458+00:00');
